# Face Off: a rink -- a centre circle with gaps at the sides, face-off
# spots, and a crease in front of each start.

NAME Face Off
SYMMETRY ROT2
WALLS Y M
START 61 24 S

# The top of the centre circle.
MOVE 11 12
DRAW 11 10
DRAW 20 10
DRAW 20 12

# The crease.
MOVE 12 4
DRAW 19 4

# A face-off spot.
MOVE 5 8
DRAW 6 8
